-- a blade for 400: points, then its place in the bag
@1000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 0
   -> send conn#2 PointsChanged 11=600
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:1 3001x1
-- ten drops for 40: 5 onto the stack of 195, the rest in a place of their own
@1000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 1
   -> send conn#2 PointsChanged 11=560
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:0 3004x200
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:2 3004x5
-- the crown costs 900000: not enough gold, nothing taken
@1000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 2
   -> send conn#2 ShopRefused 1
-- ignored: an empty place, a place the blade covers
@1000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 3
@1000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 5
-- the purchases are saved with the character
@1000 conn#2 closed: the client left
   -> store #5: save #1 at (475000, 966100) played 0s gold=560 items=[0:3004x200 1:3001x1 2:3004x5]
   -> event: conn#2: closed: the client left
@1000 store answers #5: saved: Ok(())
